---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../../../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  lang="zh-CN"
  title="反馈已收到 - Doclira PDF"
  description="感谢你提交 Doclira PDF 的使用反馈。"
>
  <Header locale="zh" />
  <main class="guide-page">
    <section class="guide-intro">
      <p class="kicker">感谢反馈</p>
      <h1>你的反馈已经发送。</h1>
      <p>我们会查看你的消息，并用于改进 Doclira PDF。如果是售后或安装问题，请稍等回复。</p>
      <div class="actions page-actions">
        <a class="primary" href="/zh/">返回首页</a>
        <a class="secondary" href="/zh/support/">联系支持</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer locale="zh" />
</Layout>
